OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 20 Nov to Sun 29 NovFA
OL,6,Fchangeable pattern is likely during
OL,7,Fthis period with Atlantic frontal
OL,8,Fsystems spreading across the UK. This
OL,9,Fmeans spells of rain and perhaps
OL,10,Fstrong winds will move over the UK at
OL,11,Ftimes, with cooler, drier interludes
OL,12,Fbetween systems. Rainfall will
OL,13,Fprobably be most frequent in parts of
OL,14,Fthe south and west and some snow is
OL,15,Flikely in the north at times.
OL,16,FTemperatures are expected to be near
OL,17,Fnormal overall, mildest in the south
OL,18,Fand coldest in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
