OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1794757687
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 30 Nov to Mon 14 Dec
OL,6,FThe tracks of low pressure systems
OL,7,Fwill likely track farther farther
OL,8,Fsouth than normal during this period.
OL,9,FThis means that rainfall will probably
OL,10,Fbe focussed across the south of the
OL,11,FUK; conversely, higher pressure to the
OL,12,Fnorth means drier conditions here.
OL,13,FTemperatures in the south will
OL,14,Fprobably be near normal or perhaps
OL,15,Fslightly above at times, with the
OL,16,Fnorth colder than normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
